 premise P_parse [implementation] retired-by: the generic table-parser theorem :: every tree the parser returns for a token list is one the grammar derives from it
 premise P_print [implementation] retired-by: an LLVM-IR semantics; not planned for slice 0 :: the printed LLVM text of a WF BIR means at most the BIR behaviour, encoded

